kmeta.py $W` | task type/splits from `mteb` (metadata only) | `$W/task_meta.parquet` | 1 min |\n26-| 3 | `python code/03_build_matrix.py $W data` | rules R1–R7 of PREREG B: one revision per model, dedup, org groups, coverage filter | `data/*` (238 models x 328 tasks, 45,775 cells) | <1 min |\n27-| 4 | `bash code/04_states.sh data $W` | stage A per fold: standardisation, factor-analysis fits for all ranks, inner group-CV rank choice per k, all-others floors, margins delta | `$W/state/{G_0..G_9,T_0,S_0}.pkl` | 5 min |\n28-| 5 | `python code/06_delta_table.py $W prereg/delta_by_fold.csv` | collects margins (committed before any contrast) | `prereg/delta_by_fold.csv` | <1 min |\n29-| 6 | `bash code/07_eval_all.sh data $W $R` | stage B: rules S0,S1,S2,S4,S5,S6,S6r,S6c x P5/P1/P0 (`05_eval.py`) | `$R/*_main.parquet` | 20 min |\n30-| 7 | `bash code/12_extra_all.sh data $W $R` | stage A2/B2: baseline tuning (`state2.py`, `baselines.py`), S3 wrapper, S7 interview, S6u, P2–P6 grid (`05b_eval_extra.py`) | `$R/*_extra.parquet`, `$W/state/*_b.pkl` | 1–2 h |\n31-| 8 | `python code/08_aggregate.py data $R results` | curves with group-bootstrap CI, contrast S6 vs S0 and verdicts, empirical vs predicted k*, Table 1 | `results/curves.csv`, `contrast_S6_vs_S0.csv`, `kstar.csv`, `excess_curve_*.csv`, `table1_*` | 5 min |\n32-| 9 | `python code/09_structure.py data $W results` | spectrum, three rank estimators, CV-vs-rank, coverage | `results/fig2_*` | 3 min |\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "57aa9069-7b0d-5ad9-a475-eb4b118d0b2b", "at": 1795732444.8001754, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 32639, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "figtab-repo", "actor": "figtab-repo", "execution_id": "e5d22816a6118fcddab608ba60637284", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "d2f0257b-c37d-520f-a139-ff1cd0d0c4